92841,"h":0,"side":"L","t":230.14,"dist":1941,"tt":106180,"src":[5]}},"shots":[{"t0":0.0,"dur":4.0,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":4.0,"dur":19.5,"zh":["遊輪從路克索出發，沿尼羅河南下亞斯文。","東岸的路克索神廟約建於西元前 1400 年。","1979 年，它與古底比斯一起列入世界遺產。"],"en":["The cruise leaves Luxor, heading south up the Nile to Aswan.","Luxor Temple, on the east bank, was built around 1400 BCE.","With Ancient Thebes, it joined the World Heritage List in 1979."]},{"t0":23.5,"dur":87.98,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":111.48,"dur":13.0,"zh":["西岸是艾德夫，荷魯斯神廟就在城中。","神廟建於西元前 237 到 57 年，是埃及保存最完整的神廟之一。"],"en":["On the west bank lies Edfu, with its temple of Horus.","Built between 237 and 57 BC, it is one of the best preserved shrines in Egypt."],"poi":"edfu"},{"t0":124.48,"dur":0.3,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":124.78,"dur":1.0,"zh":[],"en":[],"dip":true},{"t0":125.78,"dur":6.5,"zh":["第二天清晨，從艾德夫繼續南下。"],"en":["Day two: sailing on south from Edfu at dawn."]},{"t0":132.28,"dur":41.13,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":173.4,"dur":19.5,"zh":["兩岸的砂岩峭壁是西爾西拉山，在亞斯文以北 65 公里。","這裡接近尼羅河最窄處。","古埃及的大神廟，幾乎都用這裡開採的砂岩建造。"],"en":["The sandstone cliffs on both banks are Gebel el-Silsila, 65 km north of Aswan.","This is close to the narrowest point of the whole Nile.","Almost all of Ancient Egypt's great temples took their sandstone from here."],"poi":"silsila"},{"t0":192.9,"dur":17.94,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":210.85,"dur":19.5,"zh":["岸邊是康翁波神廟，一座雙神廟。","南半部供奉鱷魚神索貝克，北半部供奉鷹神荷羅埃里斯。","神廟建於托勒密王朝，西元前 180 到 47 年。"],"en":["On the bank: the Temple of Kom Ombo, a double temple.","Its southern half honours the crocodile god Sobek, its northern half the falcon god Haroeris.","It was built under the Ptolemies, 180–47 BC."],"poi":"komombo"},{"t0":230.35,"dur":0.3,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":230.65,"dur":1.0,"zh":[],"en":[],"dip":true},{"t0":231.65,"dur":6.5,"zh":["午後，從康翁波啟航前往亞斯文。"],"en":["In the afternoon, on from Kom Ombo to Aswan."]},{"t0":238.15,"dur":45.85,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":284.0,"dur":6.5,"zh":["抵達亞斯文，全程沿河約 217 公里。"],"en":["Arriving at Aswan after about 217 km on the river."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"啟航：路克索","en":"Departure: Luxor"},{"t":124.36,"tt":35989,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 1 公里：艾德夫","en":"Edfu, 1 km right","k":"edfu"},{"t":124.77,"tt":36000,"kind":"leg","zh":"靠岸停泊","en":"Moored"},{"t":182.18,"tt":98469,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 594 公尺：西爾西拉山","en":"Gebel el-Silsila, 594 m left","k":"silsila"},{"t":230.14,"tt":106180,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 2 公里：康翁波","en":"Kom Ombo, 2 km left","k":"komombo"},{"t":230.64,"tt":106200,"kind":"leg","zh":"靠岸停泊","en":"Moored"},{"t":300.0,"tt":129000,"kind":"arr","zh":"抵達：亞斯文","en":"Arrival: Aswan"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：路線取自 OpenStreetMap，速度與時間為示意，並非實際班次紀錄；地形與衛星影像為真實資料。","en":"Simulation: the path comes from OpenStreetMap; speeds and times are illustrative, not a real timetable. Terrain and satellite imagery are real data."},"geo_src":"OSM relation 50793 (Nile, waterway), shortest path along main and side streams from Luxor to Aswan","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Luxor Temple","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/Luxor_Temple"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Temple of Edfu","url":"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Temple_of_Edfu"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Gebel el-Silsila","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/articles/Gebel_el-Silsila"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Temple of Kom Ombo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temple_of_Kom_Ombo"}]}